    AND --> D[AndroidDecoderAdapter]
    AND --> E[AndroidEncoderAdapter]
    D --> F[AMediaCodec decoder]
    E --> G[AMediaCodec encoder]
    G --> H[Input ByteBuffer MVP]
    G --> I[Input Surface Phase 2]
    D --> J[Output ByteBuffer / NV12 MVP]
    D --> K[Surface or AHardwareBuffer Phase 2]

    F --> L[media/NdkMediaCodec.h]
    G --> L
    I --> M[ANativeWindow]
